## User

Insert an element into a sorted list, keeping it sorted.

## Type

type
```haskell
insertSorted :: Ord a => a -> [a] -> [a]
```

## Term

```haskell
insertSorted x [] = [x]
insertSorted x (y:ys)
  | x < y     = x : y : ys
  | otherwise = y : insertSorted x ys
```

